  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Temporary institutional support to Mozambiques National Commission    for Human Rights (CNDH) aiming to get the young institution off the   ground and get started with its task. The CNDH will, after this       support, be expected to entirely finance its operations with          government funds./CS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tempor&#xe4;rt institutionellt st&#xf6;d till Mo&#xe7;ambiques Nationella            Institution f&#xf6;r MR (CNDH) som &#xe4;mnar f&#xe5; den unga institutionen upp p&#xe5;  f&#xf6;tter och komma ig&#xe5;ng med sin verksamhet som, efter detta st&#xf6;d,      enbart skall finansieras med statliga medel./CS</narrative>
